name=DownedRP
id=DownedRP
description=DownedRP - Standalone knockdown, self-treatment and assisted-walk system for Project Zomboid B42 multiplayer.
description=Based on Down But Not Out by phasmoware (Workshop ID 3774055538).
description=Original code licensed under MIT. See LICENSE_DBNO.txt.
description=Features:
description=- Health-threshold knockdowns with crawl, bleedout timer and hold-health modes
description=- Teammate "Help Up" revive with configurable duration and restored health
description=- Knockdown strike counter: after N knockdowns in a window the next one is fatal
description=- Self-treatment: downed players may treat their own wounds if their First Aid level allows it, then stand up
description=- Assisted walk: after a revive the rescued player follows the rescuer at reduced speed
description=- MoodleFramework moodle showing recent knockdowns
require=MoodleFramework
pzversion=42
tags=Gameplay,Multiplayer,Medical,Roleplay
version=1.0.24
author=JexZucker